    <string name="about_title" translatable="false">VidStash %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_text">Save videos and audio to watch offline, with a built-in player.\n\nVidStash is free and open-source software under the GNU General Public License v3. You can read, change and share its source code.\n\nVidStash is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to YouTube or Google. \"YouTube\" is a trademark of Google LLC.\n\nPlease download only videos you have the right to keep, such as your own uploads, Creative Commons videos, or content the creator allows you to save, and respect copyright where you live.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">VidStash has no accounts, no ads, no analytics and no tracking. Nothing about you or what you watch is sent to the developer.\n\nThe app connects only to:\n• YouTube, to find and download the videos you ask for (like a web browser would).\n• SponsorBlock (sponsor.ajay.app), only if you turn on \"Remove sponsor segments\".\n• GitHub, to check for and download app updates.\n\nYour downloads, history, searches and settings stay on your phone. Backups are files you save yourself.</string>
